    # When alien t becomes an adult:
    #   current_stones[t] += active_adults
    #   For all j < t where current_stones[j] > 0:
    #     current_stones[j] -= 1
    #     If current_stones[j] becomes 0, active_adults decreases.
    
    # This still looks like O(N^2) if we update all j.
    # However, notice that an adult's stone count only decreases by 1 each time 
    # a new alien becomes an adult, provided they have stones.
    # Let's track how many times an adult has given a stone.
